(Thus a clean larger graph exists if and only if a clean core with empty) Tj
T*
(shadow exists.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(7. Shadow closure theorem) Tj
T*
(=========================) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(If:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(C_n^{a,b} is not empty,) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(and:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(for every G in C_n^{a,b}) Tj
T*
(and every connection map chi : V\(G\) -> {red, blue},) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Phi_{a,b,G}\(chi\) is not empty,) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(then:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(C_{succ\(n\)}^{a,b} is empty.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Therefore:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(R\(a,b\) = succ\(n\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This is the theoretical form of the Machura Shadow Closure.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(8. Falsification criterion) Tj
T*
