(MACHURA RAMSEY SHADOW THEOREM MAP) Tj
T*
(V05 ONE VIEW) Tj
T*
(=================================) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Author:) Tj
T*
(Michal Machura) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Purpose:) Tj
T*
(One-view formal map of the Machura Ramsey Shadow theory using standard) Tj
T*
(Ramsey-theoretic terminology.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This file is theoretical.) Tj
T*
(It does not contain a numerical proof.) Tj
T*
(It does not enumerate graphs.) Tj
T*
(It does not expose solver internals.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Standard Ramsey objects) Tj
T*
